New DocTree element `<line_break>`.

The `<line_break>` element is a compatibility addition.

In rST, the recommended syntax for use cases like poems or addresses
is a "line block". However, translating a Markdown "hard line break"
or a HTML `<br>` into a `<line_block>` with two or more `<lines>`
is tricky and error prone.
Using the inline `<line_break>` element as representation in the
Document Tree makes translating explicit line breaks into HTML,
LaTeX, troff, and ODT straigtforward.

Fixes [feature-requests:#101].

